  "type": "Album + Compilation",
  "description": "Tell Mama is the seventh studio album by American singer Etta James. Her second album release for Cadet Records, produced by Rick Hall at his FAME Studios in Muscle Shoals, Alabama, it was James's first album since 1964 to enter the Billboard 200 chart. It contained her first Top 10 R&B hits since 1964 – the title cut and \"Security\". The \"Tell Mama\" single gave James her all-time highest Billboard Hot 100 position, reaching number 23.",
